#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.DESC"
msgid "An innocent little Hatchling.\n\nIn time, it will mature into an adult <link=\"HATCH\">Hatch</link>."
msgstr "Невинный маленький детеныш норника.\n\nСо временем он вырастет во взрослого <link=\"HATCH\">Норника</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.NAME"
