#. STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.NEWMUTANTSEED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.NEWMUTANTSEED.NAME"
msgid "New Mutant Seed Discovered"
