#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.TOOLTIPS.PROCESSEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.TOOLTIPS.PROCESSEDITEM"
msgid "Refining this material produces <style=\"KKeyword\">{0}</style>"
