#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.TOOLTIPS.PRODUCES_RESEARCH_POINTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.TOOLTIPS.PRODUCES_RESEARCH_POINTS"
